Web parity (features/system/components/CommandConfirmDialog.tsx), reproduced:
  • Always-destructive red AlertTriangle; title = t(def.labelKey, def.labelFallback);
    message = t(def.confirmKey ?? '', def.confirmFallback ?? 'Are you sure?').
  • Optional confirmInput → "Type \"{{word}}\" to confirm:" + field; match is CASE-INSENSITIVE + trimmed.
  • Optional countdown → per-second decrement (prev<=1 ? 0 : prev-1); Confirm disabled + dimmed (opacity .5)
    + label "Confirm (Ns)" until remaining==0. canConfirm = remaining==0 && typedMatches.
  • Cancel (ghost) / Confirm (danger, spinner while loading); Esc/backdrop → onClose (swallowed while busy).
  • i18n keys from source: common.cancel, common.confirm, commands.confirm.typeToConfirm (+ 'Are you sure?').
  • States added for P4 (never a blank box): loading / empty / error+retry / stale chip+auto-refresh / offline.
  • Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every interactive element; Dynamic Type; reduce-motion via TSFadeIn;
    autocapitalization disabled on iOS for the typed field (macOS no-op).
  • Telemetry: view.opened emitted once with surface slug "CommandConfirmDialog" (P1/S11).

